    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-Create Telecom Sim Activate-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM Activation API facilitates the activation of multiple SIM cards in a single batch processing request. Designed for telecom service providers, this API enhances operational efficiency by allowing the quick activation of numerous SIMs simultaneously. Users can submit activation requests, which trigger the necessary backend processes to enable service for the specified SIM cards. Typical consumers include telecom companies seeking to streamline their SIM management processes and improve customer onboarding experiences.",
